Given an integer $w \ge 3$. Consider $w$ real numbers $x_1, x_2, \dots, x_w$ satisfying at the same time the following conditions:

i/  $x_1 \ge x_2 \ge \dots \ge x_w$;
ii/  $\sum_{i=1}^{w} x_i = 0$;
iii/  $\sum_{i=1}^{w} x_i^2 = w(w-1)$.

Find the maximum and the minimum values of the sum $S = x_1 + x_2$.

